<title>USA: Calif sets same to lower return rate for utilities.</title>
<headline>Calif sets same to lower return rate for utilities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The California Public Utilities Commission (CPUC) said it has approved an unchanged 1997 return on common equity and lowered the return on rate base for three of four energy utilities in the state.</p>
<p>The return on common equity will remain at 11.6 percent in 1997 for Pacific Gas and Electric Co, ENOVA Corp unit San Diego Gas and Electric Co, Edison International subisidiary Southern California Edison Co and Southern California Gas Co, the CPUC said.</p>
</text>
